  "colonia_master_list_note": "Set 2026-08-24 at the operator's direction. Union of two public sources, reconciled accent-insensitively: (1) postal-code asentamientos for CP 48280-48399 via the Zippopotam API (aggregated postal data, not official SEPOMEX; full polite sweep, 42 assigned CPs, 132 names) and (2) 26 OpenStreetMap places/residential areas, of which 23 were not already in the postal list. Full provenance per name in state/colonia_master_list.draft.json. Known caveat: name variants may duplicate real places (e.g. 'Pitillal' vs 'El Pitillal'); reconcile as they are heard from. Additionally 19 colonias already heard from in news records (evidence-backed) were absent from both sources and are included — proof the postal+OSM union is a floor, not a complete inventory.",
